        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\({}^{16}C_9\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "c",
      "answer_source": "derived",
      "explanation": "\\(\\left(x^2 + 2 + \\dfrac{1}{x^2}\\right)^8 = \\left(x + \\dfrac{1}{x}\\right)^{16}\\)। পদসংখ্যা \\(17\\), তাই মধ্যপদ \\(9\\)ম পদ।\n\\(T_9 = {}^{16}C_8 \\left(x\\right)^8\\left(\\dfrac{1}{x}\\right)^8 = {}^{16}C_8\\)।",
